[Options]
[A.]
<h2>~rX~. marks the ~yspot~[Inugget.*]~[Inugget.1]~.</h2>
Digging for treasure?<br>
Info is critical here.<br>
$Button=I Want Info,Tell,Info
$Button=Don't Want Info,Tell,No

[Info]
<h2>Info:</h2><br>
You are denied of the outpost until you kill one of the oter islands (I don't want you to control the middle island).<br>
To make it hard for you to get the outpost, all the outer islands have instant reaction and thunder power.  Wind islands protect them from close attacks.<br>
Your ai has sun power.<br>
All the geysers (until some start popping up) are locating in the middle of the X.<br>
$Button=Saying of the map,Tell,Say
$Button=Thanx,Do,Nothing

[Say]
<i>Steps to find storm power:<br>
1) Find a island that has no bridges connected to it.<br>
2) Build a outpost.<br>
3) Wait an hour.<br>
4) Dig in the middle.<br>
...<br>
--"Storm Power"...Author unknown.
$Button=Cool,Tell,Info

[No]
Want to get right to the fight, huh?<br>
To bad, you got another message.<br>
$Button=No more messages!,Tell,None

[None]
I think you shall reconsider.
$Button=Ok,Tell,Info
$Button=NO!!!,Tell,HellNo

